## Data model (SQLite)

| Table | Purpose |
| ----- | ------- |
| `games` | Library entries — title, provider, platform, launch JSON, artwork JSON, playtime, achievements |
| `import_sources` | Registered importer paths per provider |
| `play_sessions` | Launch/stop history with PID, duration, exit code |
| `settings` | Key/value JSON (`themeId`, `theGamesDbApiKey`, `steamGridDbApiKey`, `rawgApiKey`, `autoEnrichOnImport`) |
| `collections` / `collection_games` | Future grouping (schema present) |
| `user_overrides` | Per-game override JSON |
| `schema_migrations` | Migration versioning |

Database path: `~/Library/Application Support/Orbit/orbit.sqlite3` (see `src-tauri/src/utils/paths.rs`).

Separate metadata cache: `~/Library/Application Support/Orbit/metadata.sqlite` (TheGamesDB + artwork paths per library game).

Artwork may be a filesystem path under `artwork-cache/` (preferred), an http(s) URL, or a small inline Base64 data URL in `artwork_json`. Heavy Base64 payloads are spilled to `artwork-cache/` on save and when listing the library.

