## Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
  User((User + Controller))
  React["React Frontend<br/>(Vite + TypeScript)"]
  Tauri["Tauri 2 Shell<br/>(Rust)"]
  SQLite[(SQLite)]
  FS["Filesystem / Processes"]
  Importers["Importers<br/>(Steam, Astris, GameHub, Native)"]

  User --> React
  React -->|"invoke()"| Tauri
  Tauri --> SQLite
  Tauri --> FS
  Tauri --> Importers
  Importers --> FS
```

